    }
  ],
  "bullets": [
    "CREAMY CHICKEN NOODLE: A deliciously creamy chicken broth with carrots, chicken, egg noodles, and more; This indulgent, creamy chicken noodle soup makes a delicious addition to lunch or dinner",
    "CANNED SOUP: Enjoy a bowl of warm, comforting Progresso soup with 130 calories per one-cup serving",
    "QUALITY INGREDIENTS: No artificial flavors or colors from artificial sources",
    "QUICK AND EASY: Progresso soup is ready to serve; Unlike instant ramen, there's no need to add water - just warm it on a stovetop or in a microwave in minutes (if hot, handle with care)",
    "CONTAINS: One 18.5 oz can of shelf-stable Progresso Rich and Hearty Creamy Chicken and Homestyle Noodle Soup; About two servings per can"
  ],
  "category": "Dry",
  "description": "Discover the rich flavor and satisfying heartiness of our Progresso Rich and Hearty Creamy Chicken and Homestyle Noodles Soup. It's made with enticing ingredients like a deliciously creamy chicken broth, carrots, chicken, egg noodles, and more. This canned soup packs in all the taste with 130 calories per one-cup serving. Our chicken noodle soup contains no artificial flavors and no colors from artificial sources. Just the deliciousness you expect from Progresso. Heat and serve in just minutes as part of an easy lunch or dinner. Pair it with salted crackers, a toasted sandwich, or fresh bread for the ultimate comfort food combo. Warm it up on the stovetop or in the microwave, no water needed. Handle with care, stir, and enjoy! At Progresso, we're passionate about making great products. We've been creating soups ranging from Chicken Noodle to Tomato Basil and beyond for more than 100 years. And today, Progresso still uses quality ingredients for enticing flavor found in our line of canned soup products. Contains one 18.5 oz can of shelf-stable Progresso Rich and Hearty Creamy Chicken and Homestyle Noodle Soup; about two servings per can.",
